{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S11等较短段落中，感受句和比喻仍然偏密，有些音乐意象（如F小调、管风琴、马祖卡）容易让观众忙于理解文字，反而挤占听音乐的注意力；X的短词在快速扫视时更轻便。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然文字更丰富，但【】突出人物每一步心理变化的关键，话与感受交替呈现，又通过到时出现把感受放回音乐发生的具体时刻，实际观看时更容易抓住重点。更重要的是，Y不仅告诉观众他难过、怀念、犹豫，还让人理解他为什么既舍不得过去又不愿回去，并通过反复出现的音乐意象把这些变化连成一段完整的心理历程，感受也比X的短词标签更加具体、细腻。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bad64d89-4849-4e3e-bb3a-de86c25bebec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T065038632510Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:51:25.651835+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6f8edc631b804c2718824a1dd58f775d8ac13a2ded718f6f300328f0fe9096f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\